{"id": "9th-u6-q018", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "assertion_reason", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u6", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u6-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "machines-assertion", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கூற்று (A): தற்கால மனிதனின் அன்றாட வாழ்க்கையை இயந்திரங்களும் இணையமும் முற்றிலும் எளிமையாக்கியுள்ளன.\nகாரணம் (R): நீண்ட வரிசையில் பல மணி நேரம் நின்று செய்ய வேண்டிய பணப் பரிவர்த்தனைகள், பயணச்சீட்டுப் பதிவுகள், கட்டணம் செலுத்துதல் போன்றவற்றை நொடிப்பொழுதில் வீட்டிலிருந்தே செய்ய முடிகிறது.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(A) சரி, ஆனால் (R) தவறு", "B": "(A) மற்றும் (R) இரண்டும் சரி; மேலும் (R) என்பது (A) விற்கு சரியான விளக்கம்", "C": "(A) தவறு, ஆனால் (R) சரி", "D": "(A) மற்றும் (R) இரண்டும் தவறு"}, "explanation": "இயந்திரங்களும் இணையமும் மக்களின் நேர விரயத்தைத் தடுத்து, அன்றாட சேவைகளை விரல் நுனியில் கொண்டு சேர்த்துள்ளன. கூற்று, காரணம் இரண்டும் சரி, தக்க விளக்கமாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Assertion (A): Automation and internet systems have transformed and streamlined contemporary human lifestyle.\nReason (R): Tedious, time-consuming transactions like bank deposits, ticket reservations, and utility bill clearances are now accomplished instantaneously from home.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(A) is true, but (R) is false", "B": "Both (A) and (R) are true, and (R) is the correct explanation of (A)", "C": "(A) is false, but (R) is true", "D": "Both (A) and (R) are false"}, "explanation": "Both assertion and reason are true and logically coherent; automated online banking and e-services have eradicated physical queues."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 101, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 101", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_6", "machines", "assertion_reason"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u6-q019", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u6", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u6-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "xerox-first-commercial-year", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஜெராக்ஸ் நிறுவனம் தனது முதல் வணிக ரீதியான முழுமையான தானியங்கி ஒளிப்படி இயந்திரத்தை (Xerox 914) எந்த ஆண்டு அறிமுகப்படுத்தியது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1945", "B": "1950", "C": "1959", "D": "1965"}, "explanation": "செஸ்டர் கார்ல்சனின் கண்டுபிடிப்பை அடிப்படையாகக் கொண்டு 'ஜெராக்ஸ் 914' என்ற முதல் வணிகரீதியான தானியங்கி உலர் ஒளிப்படி இயந்திரம் 1959 ஆம் ஆண்டு விற்பனைக்கு வந்தது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In which year did the Haloid Xerox Corporation launch the first fully automated commercial plain paper photocopier (Xerox 914)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1945", "B": "1950", "C": "1959", "D": "1965"}, "explanation": "The Xerox 914 commercial plain paper copier was released to the market in 1959."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 101, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 101", "url": null, "source_note