{"id": "9th-u6-q044", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u6", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u6-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "irctc-concurrent-users", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "IRCTC இணையதளம் ஒரே நேரத்தில் எத்தனை பயனாளிகள் (Concurrent Users) வலைதளத்தை அணுகும் தாங்குதிறனைக் கொண்டுள்ளது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "50,000 பயனாளிகள்", "B": "1,00,000 பயனாளிகள்", "C": "2,00,000 பயனாளிகள்", "D": "3,00,000-க்கும் மேற்பட்ட பயனாளிகள்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் குறிப்பின்படி, IRCTC இணையதளம் ஒரே நேரத்தில் 3 லட்சத்திற்கும் அதிகமான பயனாளர்கள் ஒரே சமயத்தில் புகுந்து பயணச்சீட்டு முன்பதிவு செய்யும் தாங்குதிறனைக் கொண்டுள்ளது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What concurrent user handling capacity does the IRCTC portal support simultaneously according to textbook data?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "50,000 users", "B": "100,000 users", "C": "200,000 users", "D": "Over 300,000 concurrent users"}, "explanation": "The IRCTC portal was architected to sustain over 300,000 concurrent users simultaneously."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 104, "c