{"id": "9th-u6-q061", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u6", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u6-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "vairamuthu-poem-lines-rocket", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"ஏவுகணையிலும் தமிழை எழுதி எல்லாக்கோளிலும் ஏற்றிடுங்கள்!\" - என்று பாடிய கவிஞர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கவிஞர் வைரமுத்து", "B": "பாரதியார்", "C": "பாரதிதாசன்", "D": "கண்ணதாசன்"}, "explanation": "'ஏவுகணையிலும் தமிழை எழுதி எல்லாக்கோளிலும் ஏற்றிடுங்கள்' என்று விண்ணியலிலும் அறிவியல் தளத்திலும் தமிழ் மொழி உலகாள வேண்டும் என்று கவிஞர் வைரமுத்து முழங்கியுள்ளார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"Inscribe Tamil upon orbital rockets and launch it to touch every celestial sphere!\" - Which modern poet declared this?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Kavignar Vairamuthu", "B": "Subramania Bharati", "C": "Bharathidasan", "D": "Kannadasan"}, "explanation": "Vairamuthu penned this clarion call envisioning Tamil expanding into space exploration and planetary physics."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 106, "chapter": null, "section": null, "referen