{"id": "9th-u6-q092", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u6", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u6-l4", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "k-sivan-isro-chairman", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "இந்திய விண்வெளி ஆய்வு மையத்தின் (ISRO) ஒன்பதாவது தலைவராகப் பொறுப்பேற்றுச் சாதனை படைத்த தமிழக விஞ்ஞானி யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "விக்ரம் சாராபாய்", "B": "சதீஷ் தவான்", "C": "மயில்சாமி அண்ணாதுரை", "D": "டாக்டர் கே. சிவன்"}, "explanation": "கன்னியாகுமரி மாவட்டம் சரக்கல்விளையைச் சேர்ந்த டாக்டர் கே. சிவன் அவர்கள் இந்திய விண்வெளி ஆய்வு மையத்தின் (ISRO) 9ஆவது தலைவராகப் பொறுப்பேற்றார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which eminent scientist from Tamil Nadu served as the 9th Chairman of the Indian Space Research Organisation (ISRO)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Vikram Sarabhai", "B": "Satish Dhawan", "C": "Mayilsamy Annadurai", "D": "Dr. K. Sivan"}, "explanation": "Dr. K. Sivan served as the 9th Chairman of ISRO, leading multiple landmark launch vehicle programs."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 111, "chapter": null, "section": null, "referenc