{"id": "9th-u6-q097", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u6", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u6-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "nachiyar-wedding-scene", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஆண்டாளின் நாச்சியார் திருமொழிப் பாடலில் இறைவனுடன் திருமணம் நடைபெறும்போது எக்கருவிகள் முழங்கியதாகக் கனவு காண்கிறாள்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மத்தளம் கொட்ட வரிசங்கம் நின்றூத", "B": "வீணையும் தம்பூராவும் மட்டும்", "C": "குழல் மட்டும்", "D": "எக்காளம் மட்டும்"}, "explanation": "'மத்தளம் கொட்ட வரிசங்கம் நின்றூத / முத்துடைத் தாமம் நிரைதாழ்ந்த பந்தற்கீழ் / மைத்துனன் நம்பி மதுசூதனன் வந்து என்னைக் / கைத்தலம் பற்றக் கனாக்கண்டேன் தோழீ நான்' என்று ஆண்டாள் பாடுகிறாள்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In Andal's wedding dream sequence, which acoustic instruments are heralded as reverberating?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Maddalam drums beating while striped conches blow (மத்தளம் கொட்ட வரிசங்கம் நின்றூத)", "B": "Veena and Tanpura only", "C": "Flute only", "D": "Trumpets only"}, "explanation": "Andal's verse describes maddalam drums resounding and sacred conches sounding as Lord Madhusudhana holds her hand."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 108, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 108", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_6", "andal", "wedding_dream"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u6-q098", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u6", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u6-l4", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "scientists-districts-matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (விஞ்ஞானிகள் - ஊர்கள்):\n(a) மயில்சாமி அண்ணாதுரை - 1. அரியலூர்\n(b) டாக்டர் கே. சிவன் - 2. பொள்ளாச்சி (காரைப்பாடி)\n(c) வளர்மதி - 3. நாகர்கோவில் (சரக்கல்விளை)", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3", "B": "(a)-2, (b)-3, (c)-1", "C": "(a)-3, (b)-1, (c)-2", "D": "(a)-2, (b)-1, (c)-3"}, "explanation": "சரியான பொருத்தம்: மயில்சாமி அண்ணாதுரை - பொள்ளாச்சி காரைப்பாடி (2); டாக்டர் கே. சிவன் - நாகர்கோவில் சரக்கல்விளை (3); வளர்மதி - அரியலூர் (1)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the Tamil aerospace scientists with their native places:\n(a) Mayilsamy Annadurai - 1. Ariyalur\n(b) Dr. K. Sivan - 2. Pollachi (Koraavadi)\n(c) Valarmathi - 3. Nagercoil (Sarakkalvilai)", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3", "B": "(a)-2, (b)-3, (c)-1", "C": "(a)-3, (b)-1, (c)-2", "D": "(a)-2, (b)-1, (c)-3"}, "explanation": "Accurate mapping: Annadurai = Pollachi (2); Sivan = Nagercoil (3); Valarmathi = Ariyalur (1)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil N