{"id": "9th-u6-q104", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "assertion_reason", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u6", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u6-l4", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "space-science-assertion", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கூற்று (A): தமிழ் வழிப் பள்ளிகளில் பயின்ற பல அறிஞர்கள் இந்திய விண்வெளி ஆய்வு மையத்தின் (இஸ்ரோ) தலைமைப் பொறுப்புகளை அலங்கரித்துள்ளனர்.\nகாரணம் (R): டாக்டர் அப்துல் கலாம், மயில்சாமி அண்ணாதுரை, டாக்டர் கே. சிவன் உள்ளிட்ட தலைசிறந்த விஞ்ஞானிகள் அரசுப் பள்ளிகளில் தமிழ் வழியில் கற்றவர்களே.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(A) சரி, ஆனால் (R) தவறு", "B": "(A) தவறு, ஆனால் (R) சரி", "C": "(A) மற்றும் (R) இரண்டும் தவறு", "D": "(A) மற்றும் (R) இரண்டும் சரி; மேலும் (R) என்பது (A) விற்கு சரியான விளக்கம்"}, "explanation": "தமிழ் வழியில் அரசுப் பள்ளிகளில் படித்தவர்களாலும் உலகத் தரம் வாய்ந்த விண்வெளி ஆய்வு மையங்களை வழிநடத்த முடியும் என்பதை அப்துல் கலாம், மயில்சாமி அண்ணாதுரை, கே. சிவன் ஆகியோர் நிருபித்துள்ளனர். கூற்று, காரணம் இரண்டும் சரி, தக்க விளக்கமாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Assertion (A): Scientists who completed their early education in Tamil medium have risen to helm India's space program at ISRO.\nReason (R): Dr. A. P. J. Abdul Kalam, Mayilsamy Annadurai, and Dr. K. Sivan were educated in government schools through Tamil medium.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(A) is true, but (R) is false", "B": "(A) is false, but (R) is true", "C": "Both (A) and (R) are false", "D": "Both (A) and (R) are true, and (R) is the correct explanation of (A)"}, "explanation": "Both assertion and reason are true and factual; mother tongue instruction built robust scientific foundations for these space pioneers."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 110, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 110", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_6", "space_science", "assertion_reason"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u6-q105", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u6", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u6-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "andal-original-name", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஆண்டாளின் இயற்பெயர் யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கோதை", "B": "மாதவி", "C": "கண்ணகி", "D": "மணிமேகலை"}, "explanation": "பெரியாழ்வாரால் துளசித் தோட்டத்தில் கண்டெடுக்கப்பட்ட ஆண்டாளின் இயற்பெயர் 'கோதை' என்பதாகும். கோதை என்றால் மாலை என்று பொருள்படும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What was the original birth name given to Andal by Periyalwar?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Kothai (கோதை)", "B": "Madhavi", "C": "Kannagi", "D": "Manimekalai"}, "explanation": "Andal's given name was Kothai, which signifies a fragrant floral garland."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 109, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 109", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tag