{"id": "9th-u6-q116", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "analysis", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u6", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u6-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "four-punarchi-types-matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (எழுத்துகளின் அடிப்படையில் புணர்ச்சி):\n(a) மணி + அடி - 1. மெய்யீறு + மெய்முதல்\n(b) மணி + முடி - 2. உயிரீறு + உயிர்முதல்\n(c) பொன் + உண்டு - 3. உயிரீறு + மெய்முதல்\n(d) பொன் + வண்டு - 4. மெய்யீறு + உயிர்முதல்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-3, (b)-2, (c)-1, (d)-4", "B": "(a)-1, (b)-4, (c)-3, (d)-2", "C": "(a)-4, (b)-1, (c)-2, (d)-3", "D": "(a)-2, (b)-3, (c)-4, (d)-1"}, "explanation": "மணி(இ) + அடி(அ) = உயிரீறு + உயிர்முதல்; மணி(இ) + முடி(ம்) = உயிரீறு + மெய்முதல்; பொன்(ன்) + உண்டு(உ) = மெய்யீறு + உயிர்முதல்; பொன்(ன்) + வண்டு(வ்) = மெய்யீறு + மெய்முதல். எனவே சரியான வரிசை: 2, 3, 4, 1."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the sandhi combinations with their structural base types:\n(a) Mani + Adi - 1. Meyyeeru + Meymudhal\n(b) Mani + Mudi - 2. Uyireeru + Uyirmudhal\n(c) Pon + Undu - 3. Uyireeru + Meymudhal\n(d) Pon + Vandu - 4. Meyyeeru + Uyirmudhal", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-3, (b)-2, (c)-1, (d)-4", "B": "(a)-1, (b)-4, (c)-3, (d)-2", "C": "(a)-4, (b)-1, (c)-2, (d)-3", "D": "(a)-2, (b)-3, (c)-4, (d)-1"}, "explanation": "Mani + Adi = Uyireeru + Uyirmudhal (2); Mani + Mudi = Uyireeru + Meymudhal (3); Pon + Undu = Meyyeeru + Uyirmudhal (4); Pon + Vandu = Meyyeeru + Meymudhal (1). Correct sequence: 2, 3, 4, 1."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 113, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 113", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_6", "punarchi", "types_matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u6-q117", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u6", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u6-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "iyalbu-punarchi", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "நிலைமொழியும் வருமொழியும் எவ்வித மாற்றமும் இன்றி இயல்பாக இணைவது எவ்வகைப் புணர்ச்சி?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "இயல்பு புணர்ச்சி", "B": "விகாரப் புணர்ச்சி", "C": "உடம்படுமெய்ப் புணர்ச்சி", "D": "குற்றியலுகரப் புணர்ச்சி"}, "explanation": "நிலைமொழியும் வருமொழியும் எவ்வித மாற்றமும் இன்றி இணைவது இயல்பு புணர்ச்சி எனப்படும். (எ.கா: தாய் + மொழி = தாய்மொழி)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What type of sandhi occurs when the preceding word and incoming word join naturally without undergoing any phonetic alteration?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Iyalbu Punarchi (Natural / Unaltered sandhi)", "B": "Vikara Punarchi (Modified sandhi)", "C": "Udambadumey Punarchi (Glottal consonant sandhi)", "D": "Kutriyalukara Punarchi (Shortened 'u' sandhi)"}, "explanation": "When words unite without addition, change, or deletion of phonemes, it is termed Iyalbu Punarchi (e.g., Thai + Mozhi = Thaimozhi)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation"