{"id": "9th-u6-q119", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "application", "level": "application", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u6", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u6-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thondral-vikaram", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'நுழைவு + தேர்வு = நுழைவுத்தேர்வு' - இப்புணர்ச்சியில் நிகழ்ந்துள்ள விகாரம் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "திரிதல் விகாரம்", "B": "கெடுதல் விகாரம்", "C": "தோன்றல் விகாரம்", "D": "இயல்பு புணர்ச்சி"}, "explanation": "நுழைவு + தேர்வு என்பதில் 'த்' என்ற புதிய மெய்யெழுத்து இடையில் தோன்றியதால் இது தோன்றல் விகாரப் புணர்ச்சி ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the sandhi compound 'நுழைவு + தேர்வு = நுழைவுத்தேர்வு', what kind of phonetic modification has taken place?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Thrithal (Mutation)", "B": "Keduthal (Elision)", "C": "Thondral (Insertion / Appearance)", "D": "Iyalbu (Unaltered)"}, "explanation": "Since an extra consonant 'th' (த்) appears between Nuzaivu and Thaervu, it represents Thondral Vikaram (insertion)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 114, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Uni