{"id": "9th-u6-q120", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "application", "level": "application", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u6", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u6-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thrithal-vikaram", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கீழ்க்கண்டவற்றுள் 'திரிதல் விகாரத்திற்கு' சரியான சான்று எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வாழை + மரம் = வாழைமரம்", "B": "தமிழ் + தாய் = தமிழ்த்தாய்", "C": "மரம் + வேர் = மரவேர்", "D": "பல் + பொடி = பற்பொடி"}, "explanation": "பல் + பொடி என்பதில் 'ல்' என்ற மெய்யெழுத்து 'ற்' என்று திரிந்ததால் இது திரிதல் விகாரம் ஆகும். (வாழைமரம் - இயல்பு, தமிழ்த்தாய் - தோன்றல், மரவேர் - கெடுதல்)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which of the following is a correct exemplar of 'Thrithal Vikaram' (phonetic mutation)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Vazhai + Maram = Vazhaimaram", "B": "Thamizh + Thai = Thamizhthai", "C": "Maram + Ver = Maraver", "D": "Pal + Podi = Parpodi (பல் + பொடி = பற்பொடி)"}, "explanation": "In 'Pal + Podi = Parpodi', the alveolar lateral 'l' (ல்) mutates into hard 'r' (ற்), exemplifying Thrithal (mutation)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 114, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 114", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_6", "thrithal_vikaram"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u6-q121", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "application", "level": "application", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u6", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u6-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "keduthal-vikaram", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'மரம் + வேர் = மரவேர்' என்பதில் நிகழ்ந்துள்ள புணர்ச்சி மாற்றம் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "நிலைமொழியின் 'ம்' கெட்டது (கெடுதல் விகாரம்)", "B": "வருமொழியின் 'வ்' திரிந்தது", "C": "'வ்' தோன்றியது", "D": "இயல்பாகப் புணர்ந்தது"}, "explanation": "மரம் + வேர் புணரும் போது நிலைமொழி ஈற்று மகரமெய் 'ம்' மறைந்து (கெட்டு) மரவேர் என்றானது. இது கெடுதல் விகாரம்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the sandhi union 'மரம் + வேர் = மரவேர்', which structural transformation has occurred?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "The final 'm' (ம்) of the preceding word was dropped (Keduthal / Elision)", "B": "The initial 'v' mutated", "C": "A new 'v' was inserted", "D": "It combined naturally without change"}, "explanation": "The terminal consonant 'm' of Maram disappears when joining Ver, yielding Maraver, which represents Keduthal (elision)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025",