{"id": "9th-u6-q122", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "analysis", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u6", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u6-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "two-vikarams-single-word", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'நாடகம் + கலை = நாடகக்கலை' - இப்புணர்ச்சியில் நிகழ்ந்துள்ள இரு விகாரங்கள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தோன்றலும் திரிதலும்", "B": "கெடுதலும் தோன்றலும்", "C": "திரிதலும் கெடுதலும்", "D": "இயல்பும் தோன்றலும்"}, "explanation": "நாடகம் + கலை என்பதில் நிலைமொழி ஈற்று 'ம்' கெட்டது (கெடுதல் விகாரம்); 'க்' என்னும் மெய்யெழுத்து தோன்றியது (தோன்றல் விகாரம்). ஒரே சொல்லில் இரண்டு விகாரங்கள் நிகழ்ந்துள்ளன."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In 'நாடகம் + கலை = நாடகக்கலை', which two modifications take place simultaneously in a single sandhi operation?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Insertion and Mutation", "B": "Elision and Insertion (கெடுதலும் தோன்றலும்)", "C": "Mutation and Elision", "D": "Natural sandhi and Insertion"}, "explanation": "The final 'm' drops out (Keduthal), and a new hard consonant 'k' (க்) appears (Thondral), demonstrating two distinct modifications."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 114, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 114", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_6", "two_vikarams"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u6-q123", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u6", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u6-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "udambadumey-definition", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "உயிரை ஈறாக உடைய நிலைமொழியின் முன் உயிரை முதலாக உடைய வருமொழி வந்து சேரும் போது, அவ்விரண்டு உயிர்களையும் இணைக்க இடையில் தோன்றும் மெய்யெழுத்தை எவ்வாறு அழைப்பர்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சாரியை", "B": "வல்லெழுத்து", "C": "உடம்படுமெய்", "D": "சுட்டெழுத்து"}, "explanation": "உயிர் முன் உயிர் வரும் போது இரண்டும் இணையாது. அவ்விரு உயிர்களையும் உடம்படுத்துவதற்கு (இணைப்பதற்கு) இடையில் தோன்றும் மெய் 'உடம்படுமெய்' எனப்படும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "When a vowel-ending word meets a vowel-starting word, what is the bridging consonant termed that links the two vowels?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Saariyai (Inflectional increment)", "B": "Vallezhuthu (Hard consonant)", "C": "Udambadumey (Euphonic bridging consonant / Glottal glide)", "D": "Suttezhuthu (Demonstrative letter)"}, "explanation": "In Tamil grammar, vowels do not coalesce directly; the bridging consonant that reconciles two adjacent vowels is known as Udambadumey."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 114, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 114", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_6", "udambadumey", "definition"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u6-q124", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "knowledge", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u6", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u6-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "udambadumey-letters", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழ் இலக்கணத்தில் உடம்படுமெய்களாக வரும் எழுத்துகள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "க், ச்", "B": "த், ப்", "C": "ங், ஞ்", "D": "ய், வ்"}, "explanation": "தமிழ் இலக்கணத்தில் 'ய்', 'வ்' ஆகிய இரு மெய்யெழுத்துகளும் உடம்படுமெய்களாக வருகின்றன."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which two consonants act as Udambadumey (glide consonants) in Tamil grammar?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "k, ch", "B": "th, p", "C": "ng, nj", "D": "y, v (ய், வ்)"}, "explanation": "The two semi-vowels/consonants 'y' (ய்) and 'v' (வ்) serve exclusively as Udambadumey."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 114, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 114", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_6", "udambadumey", "letters"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u6-q125", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u6", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u6-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "nannool-udambadumey-rule1", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "நன்னூல் நூற்பாப்படி, நிலைமொழியின் ஈற்றெழுத்தாக 'இ, ஈ, ஐ' வரும்போது உடம்படுமெய்யாக எது தோன்றும்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ய்", "B": "வ்", "C": "ர்", "D": "ல்"}, "explanation": "'இ ஈ ஐ வழி யவ்வும்' என்பது நன்னூல் விதி. நிலைமொழியின் ஈற்றில் இ, ஈ, ஐ ஆகிய உயிர்கள் நின்றால் 'ய்' உடம்படுமெய்யாக வரும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "According to the Nannool sutra, which glide consonant appears when the preceding word ends in 'i', 'ee', or 'ai' (இ, ஈ, ஐ)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "'y' (ய்)", "B": "'v' (வ்)", "C": "'r' (ர்)", "D": "'l' (ல்)"}, "explanation": "The Nannool rule states 'I Ee Ai vazhi yavvum' (இ ஈ ஐ வழி யவ்வும்), meaning 'y' (ய்) is inserted after i, ee, and ai."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 114, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 114", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_6", "nannool", "udambadumey_y"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u6-q126", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "application", "level": "application", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u6", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u6-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "udambadumey-y-examples", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கீழ்க்கண்டவற்றுள் 'இ ஈ ஐ வழி யவ்வும்' என்ற விதிக்கு உட்படாத சான்று எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மணி + அழகு = மணியழகு", "B": "பல + உயிர் = பலவுயிர்", "C": "தீ + எரிகிறது = தீயெரிகிறது", "D": "கலை + அறிவு = கலையறிவு"}, "explanation": "மணி (இ), தீ (ஈ), கலை (ஐ) ஆகியவற்றில் 'ய்' வந்தது. ஆனால் 'பல + உயிர் = பலவுயிர்' என்பதில் நிலைமொழி ஈறு 'அ' (ப்+அ+ல்+அ) என்பதால் 'வ்' வந்தது. இது 'ஏனை உயிர் வழி வவ்வும்' என்ற விதிக்குரியது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which of the following does NOT belong to the rule 'I Ee Ai vazhi yavvum'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Mani + Azhagu = Maniyazhagu", "B": "Pala + Uyir = Palavuyir", "C": "Thee + Erigirathu = Theeyerigirathu", "D": "Kalai + Arivu = Kalaiyarivu"}, "explanation": "'Pala + Uyir = Palavuyir' ends in 'a' (அ), hence takes 'v' (வ்) under 'Enai uyir vazhi vavvum', not 'y'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 114, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 114", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_6", "udambadumey_examples"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u6-q127", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u6", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u6-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "nannool-udambadumey-rule2", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'ஏனை உயிர் வழி வவ்வும்' - இவ்விதியின்படி 'ய்' நீங்கலாக ஏனைய ஒன்பது உயிர்களும் நிலைமொழி ஈறாக வரும்போது உடம்படுமெய்யாக வருவது எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ய்", "B": "ச்", "C": "வ்", "D": "த்"}, "explanation": "இ, ஈ, ஐ தவிர்த்த ஏனைய பிற உயிரெழுத்துகள் நிலைமொழி ஈறாக வரும்போது 'வ்' உடம்படுமெய்யாக வரும். (எ.கா: பல + உயிர் = பலவுயிர்)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Under the rule 'Enai uyir vazhi vavvum', which glide consonant bridges the vowels when the preceding word ends in any vowel other than i, ee, ai?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "'y' (ய்)", "B": "'ch' (ச்)", "C": "'v' (வ்)", "D": "'th' (த்)"}, "explanation": "When vowels other than i, ee, ai terminate Nilaimozhi, 'v' (வ்) serves as the bridging glide consonant."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 114, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 114", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_6", "nannool", "udambadumey_v"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u6-q128", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "analysis", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u6", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u6-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "udambadumey-e-both", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "நிலைமொழியின் இறுதி எழுத்தாக 'ஏ'காரம் வந்தால் நன்னூல் விதிப்படி உடம்படுமெய்யாக எவை வரும்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "'ய்' மட்டுமே வரும்", "B": "'வ்' மட்டுமே வரும்", "C": "உடம்படுமெய் வராது", "D": "'ய்', 'வ்' ஆகிய இரண்டும் வரும் ('ஏமுன் இவ்விருமையும்')"}, "explanation": "'ஏமுன் இவ்விருமையும்' என்பது நன்னூல் விதி. நிலைமொழி ஈற்றில் 'ஏ' வரும் போது 'ய்', 'வ்' ஆகிய இரு உடம்படுமெய்களும் வரும். (சான்று: சே + அடி = சேயடி / சேவடி, தே + ஆரம் = தேயாரம் / தேவாரம்)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "According to the Nannool grammar rule, what happens when Nilaimozhi ends with the vowel 'Ae' (ஏ)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Only 'y' appears", "B": "Only 'v' appears", "C": "No glide consonant appears", "D": "Both 'y' and 'v' may appear ('Aemun ivvirumaiyum' - ஏமுன் இவ்விருமையும்)"}, "explanation": "'Aemun ivvirumaiyum' indicates that before the vowel 'Ae', both 'y' and 'v' are valid bridging consonants (e.g., Saeyadi / Saevadi)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 114, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 114", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_6", "nannool", "aemun_ivvirumaiyum"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u6-q129", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "application", "level": "application", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u6", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u6-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "udambadumey-e-examples", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'சே + அடி' என்பது உடம்படுமெய்ப் புணர்ச்சியில் எவ்வாறு புணரும்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சேயடி அல்லது சேவடி", "B": "சேடி மட்டுமே", "C": "சேத்தடி மட்டுமே", "D": "சேயவடி மட்டுமே"}, "explanation": "'ஏமுன் இவ்விருமையும்' என்ற விதிப்படி 'சே(ச்+ஏ) + அடி' என்பது 'ய்' பெற்று 'சேயடி' என்றும், 'வ்' பெற்று 'சேவடி' என்றும் இருவகையிலும் புணரும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "How does the sandhi combination 'சே + அடி' coalesce under the Udambadumey rule?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "As either 'Saeyadi' (சேயடி) or 'Saevadi' (சேவடி)", "B": "Exclusively as 'Saedi'", "C": "Exclusively as 'Saethadi'", "D": "Exclusively as 'Saeyavadi'"}, "explanation": "Because 'Sae' ends in 'Ae', it can accept either 'y' or 'v', yielding 'Saeyadi' or 'Saevadi'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 114, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 114", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_6", "udambadumey", "saevadi"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u6-q130", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "knowledge", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u6", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u6-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "nannool-udambadumey-sutra-completion", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "நன்னூல் உடம்படுமெய் நூற்பாவை முழுமைப்படுத்துக:\n'இ ஈ ஐவழி ______ ஏனை உயிர்வழி ______ ஏமுன் இவ்விருமையும் தூக்குமென் என்ப.'", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வவ்வும், யவ்வும்", "B": "யவ்வும், வவ்வும்", "C": "ரவ்வும், லவ்வும்", "D": "தவ்வும், பவ்வும்"}, "explanation": "'இ ஈ ஐவழி யவ்வும் ஏனை உயிர்வழி வவ்வும் ஏமுன் இவ்விருமையும் தூக்குமென் என்ப' (நன்னூல் 162)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Complete the Nannool sutra on Udambadumey:\n'I Ee Aivazhi ______ Enai uyirvazhi ______ Aemun ivvirumaiyum thookkumen enba.'", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "vavvum, yavvum", "B": "yavvum, vavvum (யவ்வும், வவ்வும்)", "C": "ravvum, lavvum", "D": "thavvum, pavvum"}, "explanation": "The complete sutra is 'I Ee Aivazhi yavvum Enai uyirvazhi vavvum Aemun ivvirumaiyum...'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 114, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 114", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_6", "nannool", "sutra_completion"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u6-q131", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u6", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u6-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kutriyalukaram-rule1", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "நிலைமொழி ஈற்றில் குற்றியலுகரம் நின்று வருமொழியின் முதல் எழுத்தாக உயிர் வரும் போது, 'உயிர்வரின் உக்குறள் மெய்விட்டு ஓடும்' என்ற விதிப்படி எது நீங்கும்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "நிலைமொழியின் மெய்யெழுத்து", "B": "வருமொழியின் உயிரெழுத்து", "C": "நிலைமொழி ஈற்று உகரம் ('உ')", "D": "வருமொழி முழுமையும்"}, "explanation": "'உயிர்வரின் உக்குறள் மெய்விட்டு ஓடும்' - நிலைமொழியின் ஈற்றில் உள்ள குற்றியலுகரம் (உக்குறள்), வருமொழியில் உயிர் எழுத்து வந்தால் தான் ஏறி நின்ற மெய்யெழுத்தை விட்டுவிட்டு நீங்கும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Under the rule 'Uyirvarin ukkural meyvittu odum', what is elided when a vowel-initial word follows a Kutriyalukaram-ending word?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "The consonant of Nilaimozhi", "B": "The vowel of Varumozhi", "C": "The shortened 'u' sound of Nilaimozhi (நிலைமொழி ஈற்று உகரம்)", "D": "The incoming word entirely"}, "explanation": "The rule specifies that the short 'u' (ukkural) leaves its consonant base and vanishes upon encountering an incoming vowel."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 115, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 115", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_6", "kutriyalukaram", "rule_understanding"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u6-q132", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u6", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u6-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kutriyalukaram-rule2", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "குற்றியலுகரப் புணர்ச்சியில் உகரம் நீங்கிய பின் மெய்ம்மீது உயிர் ஏறுவதற்குப் பயன்படும் நன்னூல் விதி எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "இ ஈ ஐ வழி யவ்வும்", "B": "ஏனை உயிர் வழி வவ்வும்", "C": "தனிக்குறில் முன் ஒற்று உயிர்வரின் இரட்டும்", "D": "உடல்மேல் உயிர்வந்து ஒன்றுவது இயல்பே"}, "explanation": "உகரம் நீங்கிய பிறகு எஞ்சியுள்ள மெய்யெழுத்தின் மீது வருமொழி உயிர் வந்து இணைவதற்கு 'உடல்மேல் உயிர்வந்து ஒன்றுவது இயல்பே' என்ற விதி பயன்படுகிறது. (இங்கு மெய் = உடல், உயிர் = உயிர்)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In Kutriyalukaram sandhi, after 'u' is dropped, which Nannool sutra governs the uniting of the remaining consonant with the following vowel?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "I Ee Ai vazhi yavvum", "B": "Enai uyir vazhi vavvum", "C": "Thani kkuril mun otru uyirvarin irattum", "D": "Udalmel uyirvandhu ondruvathu iyalbe (உடல்மேல் உயிர்வந்து ஒன்றுவது இயல்பே)"}, "explanation": "'Udalmel uyirvandhu ondruvathu iyalbe' states that an incoming vowel naturally unites with the preceding bare consonant ('body')."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 115, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 115", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_6", "nannool", "udalmel_uyir"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u6-q133", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "application", "level": "analysis", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u6", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u6-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "natu-yathu-punarchi", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'நாடு + யாது = நாடியாது' - இப்புணர்ச்சியில் நிகழ்ந்துள்ள மாற்றங்களை வரிசைப்படுத்துக:\n1. 'நாடு' என்பதில் 'டு' (ட்+உ) உள்ள உகரம் இகரமாகத் திரிந்தது.\n2. 'யகரம்' வருமொழி முதலாக வந்ததால் குற்றியலுகரம் குற்றியலிகரமானது.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கூற்று 1 மற்றும் 2 இரண்டும் சரி", "B": "கூற்று 1 சரி, 2 தவறு", "C": "கூற்று 1 தவறு, 2 சரி", "D": "இரண்டும் தவறு"}, "explanation": "நிலைமொழி குற்றியலுகரமாக இருந்து வருமொழி முதலாக 'ய'கரம் வரும்போது, நிலைமொழி ஈற்று உகரம் இகரமாகத் திரியும் (குற்றியலிகரம்). எனவே நாடு + யாது = நாடியாது. இரண்டு கூற்றுகளும் சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Analyze the sandhi transformation: 'நாடு + யாது = நாடியாது':\n1. In 'Naadu', the 'u' sound of 'du' transforms into 'i'.\n2. Because 'ya' is the initial letter of Varumozhi, Kutriyalukaram mutates into Kutriyalikaram.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Both statements 1 and 2 are correct", "B": "Statement 1 is correct, 2 is incorrect", "C": "Statement 1 is incorrect, 2 is correct", "D": "Both statements are incorrect"}, "explanation": "When Varumozhi begins with 'ya', the preceding Kutriyalukaram shifts phonetically to Kutriyalikaram ('du' -> 'di'), yielding 'Naadiyaathu'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 115, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 115", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_6", "kutriyalikaram", "analytical"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u6-q134", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "application", "level": "application", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u6", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u6-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "mutriyalukaram-uyirvarin", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'உயிர்வரின் உக்குறள் மெய்விட்டு ஓடும்' என்னும் விதி எவ்வகை உகரத்திற்கும் பொருந்தும் எனப் பாடநூல் குறிப்பிடுகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "குற்றியலிகரத்திற்கு மட்டுமே", "B": "முற்றியலுகரத்திற்கும் பொருந்தும் (எ.கா: வரவு + அறிந்தது = வரவறிந்தது)", "C": "ஐகாரக் குறுக்கத்திற்கு மட்டுமே", "D": "ஔகாரக் குறுக்கத்திற்கு மட்டுமே"}, "explanation": "பாடநூலில் 'முற்றியலுகரத்திற்கும் இவ்விதி பொருந்தும்' எனக் குறிப்பிடப்பட்டுள்ளது. (வரவு + அறிந்தது = வரவ்(உ) + அறிந்தது = வரவறிந்தது)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "To what other category of 'u' does the textbook state that the rule 'Uyirvarin ukkural meyvittu odum' also applies?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Only Kutriyalikaram", "B": "It also applies to Mutriyalukaram (e.g., வரவு + அறிந்தது = வரவறிந்தது)", "C": "Only Aigarakkurukkam", "D": "Only Ougarakkurukkam"}, "explanation": "The textbook explicitly notes that this sandhi rule also applies to Mutriyalukaram (unshortened 'u'), as demonstrated in 'Varavu + Arinthathu = Varavarinthathu'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 115, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 115", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_6", "mutriyalukaram", "sutra_extension"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u6-q135", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "application", "level": "application", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u6", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u6-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "varavarindhadhu-steps", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'வரவு + அறிந்தது = வரவறிந்தது' - இதில் நிலைமொழி ஈற்று 'வு' எவ்வகை உகரம்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "நெடில்தொடர்க் குற்றியலுகரம்", "B": "உயிர்த்தொடர்க் குற்றியலுகரம்", "C": "முற்றியலுகரம்", "D": "ஆய்தத்தொடர்க் குற்றியலுகரம்"}, "explanation": "'வரவு' என்பது குற்றியலுகரச் சொற்கள் ஆறனுள் அடங்காத, சொல்லின் இறுதியில் முழுக் கை அளவோடு ஒலிக்கும் 'முற்றியலுகரம்' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In 'வரவு + அறிந்தது = வரவறிந்தது', what type of 'u' is the ending 'vu' of Nilaimozhi?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Nedil thodark kutriyalukaram", "B": "Uyirthodark kutriyalukaram", "C": "Mutriyalukaram (முற்றியலுகரம்)", "D": "Aythathodark kutriyalukaram"}, "explanation": "'Varavu' does not fall under the six types of shortened 'u' and sounds with full mora value, making it Mutriyalukaram."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 115, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 115", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_6", "mutriyalukaram", "classification"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u6-q136", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "analysis", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u6", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u6-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "punarchi-terms-matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (புணர்ச்சிச் சொற்கள் - இலக்கணக் குறியீடு):\n(a) மணி - 1. மெய்முதல்\n(b) பொன் - 2. உயிர்முதல்\n(c) இலை - 3. மெய்யீறு\n(d) மரம் - 4. உயிரீறு", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-2, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-3", "B": "(a)-3, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-2", "C": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4", "D": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1"}, "explanation": "மணி (ண்+இ) = உயிரீறு; பொன் (ன்) = மெய்யீறு; இலை (இ) = உயிர்முதல்; மரம் (ம்+அ) = மெய்முதல். சரியான வரிசை: 4, 3, 2, 1."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the words with their sandhi technical designations:\n(a) Mani - 1. Meymudhal\n(b) Pon - 2. Uyirmudhal\n(c) Ilai - 3. Meyyeeru\n(d) Maram - 4. Uyireeru", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-2, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-3", "B": "(a)-3, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-2", "C": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4", "D": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1"}, "explanation": "Mani (ends in 'i') = Uyireeru (4); Pon (ends in 'n') = Meyyeeru (3); Ilai (begins with 'i') = Uyirmudhal (2); Maram (begins with 'm') = Meymudhal (1). Sequence: 4, 3, 2, 1."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 113, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 113", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_6", "punarchi", "matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u6-q137", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u6", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u6-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "udalmel-uyir-iyalbu-example", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'மரம் + இல்லை = மரமில்லை' - இப்புணர்ச்சியை நன்னூல் எவ்வகைப் புணர்ச்சியாகக் கருதுகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "இயல்பு புணர்ச்சி ('உடல்மேல் உயிர்வந்து ஒன்றுவது இயல்பே')", "B": "தோன்றல் விகாரம்", "C": "திரிதல் விகாரம்", "D": "கெடுதல் விகாரம்"}, "explanation": "மரம் + இல்லை என்பதில் 'ம் + இ = மி' என மெய்ம்மீது உயிர் வந்து இணைவது இயற்கை என்பதால், 'உடல்மேல் உயிர்வந்து ஒன்றுவது இயல்பே' என நன்னூல் இதனை இயல்பு புணர்ச்சியாகவே கொள்கிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In 'மரம் + இல்லை = மரமில்லை', how does Nannool classify the joining of the vowel with the consonant?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Iyalbu Punarchi ('Udalmel uyirvandhu ondruvathu iyalbe' - natural coalescence)", "B": "Thondral Vikaram (Insertion)", "C": "Thrithal Vikaram (Mutation)", "D": "Keduthal Vikaram (Elision)"}, "explanation": "Because a vowel combining with a bare consonant is an innate physical phonological occurrence, Nannool categorizes it under natural sandhi (Iyalbu)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer 