{"id": "9th-u6-q138", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "application", "level": "analysis", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u6", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u6-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kutriyalukaram-natu-undu", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'நாடு + உண்டு = நாட்டுண்டு' - இப்புணர்ச்சியில் முறைப்படி பயன்பட்ட இரு நன்னூல் விதிகள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "இ ஈ ஐ வழி யவ்வும்; ஏனை உயிர் வழி வவ்வும்", "B": "உயிர்வரின் உக்குறள் மெய்விட்டு ஓடும்; உடல்மேல் உயிர்வந்து ஒன்றுவது இயல்பே", "C": "தனிக்குறில் முன் ஒற்று உயிர்வரின் இரட்டும்; உடல்மேல் உயிர்வந்து ஒன்றுவது இயல்பே", "D": "திரிதல் விகாரம்; கெடுதல் விகாரம்"}, "explanation": "1. நாடு + உண்டு -> நாட்(உ) + உண்டு ('உயிர்வரின் உக்குறள் மெய்விட்டோடும்'); 2. நாட் + உண்டு -> நாட்டுண்டு ('உடல்மேல் உயிர்வந்து ஒன்றுவது இயல்பே')."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In 'நாடு + உண்டு = நாட்டுண்டு', which two Nannool rules are applied in methodical succession?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "I Ee Ai vazhi yavvum; Enai uyir vazhi vavvum", "B": "Uyirvarin ukkural meyvittu odum; Udalmel uyirvandhu ondruvathu iyalbe", "C": "Thani kkuril mun otru uyirvarin irattum; Udalmel uyirvandhu ondruvathu iyalbe", "D": "Thrithal Vikaram; Keduthal Vikaram"}, "explanation": "First, 'u' drops via 'Uyirvarin ukkural meyvittu odum', then the vowel joins the consonant via 'Udalmel uyirvandhu ondruvathu iyalbe'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 115, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 115", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_6", "kutriyalukaram", "sutra_application"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u6-q139", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "application", "level": "application", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u6", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u6-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "udambadumey-ma-ilai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'மா + இலை = மாவிலை' - இதில் உடம்படுமெய்யாக 'வ்' வரக் காரணம் என்ன?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "நிலைமொழியின் ஈற்றில் 'இ' வந்திருப்பதால்", "B": "நிலைமொழியின் ஈற்றில் 'ஐ' வந்திருப்பதால்", "C": "நிலைமொழியின் ஈற்றில் ஆகாரம் (ஆ) வந்திருப்பதால் ('ஏனை உயிர்வழி வவ்வும்')", "D": "வருமொழியில் மெல்லினம் வந்திருப்பதால்"}, "explanation": "'மா' (ம் + ஆ) என்பதில் நிலைமொழி ஈறு 'ஆ'. இ, ஈ, ஐ அல்லாத பிற உயிர் என்பதால் 'ஏனை உயிர் வழி வவ்வும்' என்ற விதிப்படி 'வ்' உடம்படுமெய்யாக வந்தது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In 'மா + இலை = மாவிலை', why does 'v' (வ்) appear as the bridging consonant?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Because the preceding word ends in 'i'", "B": "Because the preceding word ends in 'ai'", "C": "Because the preceding word ends in long 'aa' (ஆ) under 'Enai uyir vazhi vavvum'", "D": "Because Varumozhi begins with a nasal consonant"}, "explanation": "'Maa' ends in 'aa' (ம் + ஆ). As it is neither i, ee, nor ai, it takes 'v' as per 'Enai uyir vazhi vavvum'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 114, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 114", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_6", "udambadumey", "mavilai"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u6-q140", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "analysis", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u6", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u6-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "punarchi-true-false", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "புணர்ச்சி பற்றிய கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\nI. நிலைமொழியின் இறுதி எழுத்து உயிராக இருந்தால் அது உயிரீறு எனப்படும்.\nII. வருமொழியின் முதல் எழுத்து மெய்யாக இருந்தால் அது மெய்முதல் எனப்படும்.\nIII. மண் + குடம் = மட்குடம் என்பது தோன்றல் விகாரத்திற்குச் சான்றாகும்.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கூற்று I, II, III அனைத்தும் சரி", "B": "கூற்று I மட்டும் சரி", "C": "கூற்று II மட்டும் சரி", "D": "கூற்று I, II சரி; கூற்று III தவறு"}, "explanation": "கூற்று I மற்றும் II சரி. கூற்று III தவறு; ஏனெனில் மண் + குடம் = மட்குடம் என்பதில் 'ண்' என்ற மெய் 'ட்' ஆகத் திரிந்ததால் இது 'திரிதல் விகாரம்' ஆகும் (தோன்றல் அன்று)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Evaluate the statements regarding sandhi rules:\nI. If the terminal phoneme of Nilaimozhi is a vowel, it is termed Uyireeru.\nII. If the initial phoneme of Varumozhi is a consonant, it is termed Meymudhal.\nIII. 'Man + Kudam = Matkudam' is an example of Thondral Vikaram.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Statements I, II, and III are all correct", "B": "Only statement I is correct", "C": "Only statement II is correct", "D": "Statements I and II are correct; statement III is incorrect (திரிதல், not தோன்றல்)"}, "explanation": "Statements I and II are valid grammatical definitions. Statement III is false because 'n' changes to 't', which is Thrithal (mutation), not Thondral."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 113, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 113", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_6", "punarchi", "true_false"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}

