{"id": "9th-u6-q155", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "pyq", "level": "knowledge", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u6", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u6-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pyq-udambadumey-sutra-rule", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] 'இ ஈ ஐ வழி யவ்வும் ஏனை உயிர் வழி வவ்வும்' என்ற நூற்பா இடம்பெற்றுள்ள இலக்கண நூல் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தொல்காப்பியம்", "B": "வீரசோழியம்", "C": "நன்னூல்", "D": "இலக்கண விளக்கம்"}, "explanation": "உடம்படுமெய் குறித்த 'இ ஈ ஐ வழி யவ்வும் ஏனை உயர் வழி வவ்வும் ஏமுன் இவ்விருமையும்' என்ற புகழ்மிக்க நூற்பா பவணந்தி முனிவரின் 'நன்னூல்' நூலில் இடம்பெற்றுள்ளது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] In which premier grammatical treatise is the sutra 'I Ee Ai vazhi yavvum Enai uyir vazhi vavvum' found?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Tolkappiyam", "B": "Veerasozhiyam", "C": "Nannool (நன்னூல்)", "D": "Ilakkana Vilakkam"}, "explanation": "The famous Udambadumey sandhi aphorism is codified in Pavanandhi Munivar's masterpiece Nannool."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 114, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Un