{"id": "9th-u6-q167", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "pyq", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u6", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u6-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pyq-andal-kannin-thirumozhi", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] நாலாயிர திவ்வியப் பிரபந்தத்தில் ஆண்டாள் பாடிய திருப்பாவை எத்தனையாவது திருமுறையாக/பகுதியாக உள்ளது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "இரண்டாம் ஆயிரம்", "B": "மூன்றாம் ஆயிரம்", "C": "முதலாயிரம்", "D": "திருவாய்மொழி"}, "explanation": "நாலாயிர திவ்வியப் பிரபந்தத்தில் ஆண்டாள் பாடிய திருப்பாவை மற்றும் நாச்சியார் திருமொழி ஆகிய இரண்டும் 'முதலாயிரம்' என்னும் பகுதியில் தொகுக்கப்பட்டுள்ளன."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] In the Nalayira Divya Prabandham, under which section are Andal's Thiruppavai and Nachiyar Thirumozhi compiled?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Second Thousand (Irandam Aayiram)", "B": "Third Thousand (Moondram Aayiram)", "C": "Muthalaayiram (First Thousand - முதலாயிரம்)", "D": "Thiruvaimozhi"}, "explanation": "Both Thiruppavai and Nachiyar Thirumozhi are canonized within the Muthalaayiram section of the Nalayira Divya Prabandham."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "t